<title>GERMANY: Krupp does not hold Thyssen shares.</title>
<headline>Krupp does not hold Thyssen shares.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>German steel maker Krupp, which on Tuesday made an offer for all shares in rival Thyssen AG, does not yet hold a single Thyssen share, a Krupp spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We do not yet own a single Thyssen share, and do not have a claim on any holding,&quot; the Fried. Krupp AG Hoesch Krupp spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>The two said earlier they would begin discussions aimed at starting a joint steel company.</p>
<p>Shares in both companies have been suspended from trade on German exchanges since Monday, but have been trading actively on the grey market.</p>
</text>
